    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Feast or Fracture, where <strong>lifestyle</strong> - a measure or prosperity, stability, and luxury - is the metric of success.  Build towns, recruit units, invest in ancient research - but win by bringing every player's lifestyle to a level not seen since the Collapse.<br><br>What's involved:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a bountiful, randomly-generated world, filled with artefacts and wreckage of the Bronze Age Collapse.<br></li><li>Balance internal factions led by charismatic leaders.  Keep them happy, or your kingdom will fracture!<br></li><li>React to dozens of in-game events, with branching outcomes and kingdom-wide impacts. <br></li><li>Compete with petty, selfish neighbors - or find a way to cooperate.  Send delegations to negotiate, for everything from food donations to study abroad programs.  </li></ul><br>Can you fulfill your ultimate mission?<br><br>Can you create a better world?",
